" {}))))\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:208:  \\\"Parse UTF-8 `source` natively with `worker` and answer the checked\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:212:  [worker source]\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:213:  (let [[status bs] (call-export (handle worker) (.getBytes ^String source \\\"UTF-8\\\"))]\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:241:(defn make-worker\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:242:  \\\"A host worker for `profile`, owning a native handle with its own DFA and\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:244:   state with another worker. Host state owned by one parser stage; it is not\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:245:   data and never crosses a stream. Dispose it with `close-worker`.\\\"\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:247:  (let [h (c-worker-new)]\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:249:      (throw (ex-info \\\"jolt parser worker could not be made\\\" {})))\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:253:(defn close-worker\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:254:  \\\"Dispose `worker`'s native handle and caches. Idempotent; a closed worker\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:256:  [worker]\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:257:  (when-let [box (::native worker)]\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:261:        (c-worker-free h))))\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:276:  \\\"Parse one sealed unit's `source` with `worker`; return its CST packet.\\\"\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:277:  [worker unit source]\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:280:        records (export-records worker source)]\\n.claude/worktrees/jolt-j0c/src/jolt/yang/antlr/cst.jolt:281:    (export/result (