------+\\n527: | WebSocket                  | `dao.stream.ws`                            | `{:connect! :bind! :unbind!}` (`host.cljc:20-33`)     | Existing                    |\\n528: +----------------------------+--------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\\n529: | Datagram and UDP           | `dao.stream.datagram`, `.udp`              | `bind!` (`datagram.cljc:15-23`)                       | Existing                    |\\n530: +----------------------------+--------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\\n531: | Durable journal and the    | `dao.stream.journal` over `dao.jing.file`  | Deferred (§9.2)                                       | Deferred                    |\\n532: | storage beneath it         | and `store.fs`                             |                                                       |                             |\\n533: +----------------------------+--------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\\n534: | Entropy                    | Deferred                                   | Deferred (§9.1)                                       | Deferred                    |\\n535: +----------------------------+--------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\\n536: | Parser stage               | `yang.python.antlr.*`                      | Deferred (§9.3)                                       | Deferred                    |\\n537: +----------------------------+--------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\\n538: | wasm import surface        | `dao.stream.wasm.md` §1                    | The seven imports                                     | Existing spec               |\\n539: +----------------------------+--------------------------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\\n540: \\n541: Seam rule (`abi.md` §6-§7 as acceptance): a seam entry is implementation-\\n542: private, called only by the stream implementation that owns it; it takes\\n543: host arguments and returns or deposits plain data; it never invokes\\n544: application code; it classifies host errors into data; what it cannot do it\\n545: answers as a qualified unsupported outcome. A map of functions that portable\\n546: application code calls to reach the world is a host service and is rejected\\n547: (`abi.md:143-148`); none exists in H0-H4.\\n548: \\n549: ### 4.2 The primitive profile: exact manifest (P)\\n550: \\n551: `dao.host.*` (OQ2 adopted) is a namespace family whose files contain only\\n552: reader-conditional entries and docstrings stating each entry's law, kind (P\\n553: pure, M mutating per §2.4) and oracle. Table A is the profile (76 entries);\\n554: table B the portable code replacing host libraries; table C the runtime\\n555: prerequisites.\\n556: \\n557: **Table A: profile entries.**\\n558: \\n559: +--------------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----+-------+\\n560: | Namespace          | Entries (consolidated from, V)                                                                       | N   | Slice |\\n561: +====================+======================================================================================================+=====+=======+\\n562: | `dao.host.integer` | From `yin.vm.integer.host` (all 25, P): `big-carrier?`, `exact-integer?`, `safe-native?`,            | 28  | H1    |\\n563: |                    | `host-float?`, `nan-float?`, `infinite-float?`, `promote`, `from-native`, `demote`, `to-native`,     |     |       |\\n564: |                    | `native->doub