epl/adapter.cljc` (`:58`), `yin/repl/dht.cljc`      |                             |\\n862: |                            | (`:104`): the dialect's EDN reader under two namespaces; `dao/stream/ringbuffer.cljc` (`:168`): |                             |\\n863: |                            | the in-memory stream implementation's own host atom test (an implementation-private arm, §4.1). |                             |\\n864: +----------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\\n865: | Seams and driver           | `src/clj`, `src/cljs`, `src/cljd` seam and shadow files (§3.1 lane-specific list) **except**    | Stay, except the Dart Jing  |\\n866: |                            | `src/cljd/dao/jing/cbor/cljd.cljd`, which is a Jing writer H4 deletes, not a seam; it is on the | writer, deleted in H4.      |\\n867: |                            | baseline under the first row's `dao/jing/cbor/boring.cljc` twin. `yin/repl/main.cljc`,          |                             |\\n868: |                            | `yin/repl/host.cljc`, `yin/repl/state.cljc`.                                                    |                             |\\n869: +----------------------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------------------------+\\n870: | Deferred-scope files (§9)  | `dao/jing/file.cljc`, `dao/space/store/fs.cljc`, `dao/space/store.cljc`,                        | Stay until the deferred     |\\n871: |                            | `dao/stream/journal/file.cljc`, `dao/jing/coordinate.cljc`, `dao/space/dht.cljc`,               | design lands.               |\\n872: |                            | `dao/stream/rpc.cljc` (`:114`, the `rand` arm), `yin/repl.cljc`,                                |                             |\\n873: |                            | `yang/python/antlr/parser.cljc` and the other `yang/