               c (when (and e (= 1 (count (core/kids ctx e)))) (first (core/rules ctx e \"constant\")))\n522:   constant (:const) name: an import wins, an unqualified name inside a\n546:(defn- constant-node\n547:  \"The node of a read of constant `q` (parts of its written name). A builtin\n555:      (contains? builtins/constants primary) (builtin-constant-node (get builtins/constants primary))\n557:      ;; constant declarations are statically resolved, accepting one here\n558:      ;; defers a known unsupported construct to a runtime undefined-constant\n564:      (unsupported! n :constant)\n620:         lower-class-constant lower-initializer-part class-spec*)\n1185:      (and (= 1 (count ks)) (p/rule? k0 \"constant\"))\n1295:  \"True when expression `e` is syntactically a literal or constant, so the\n1301:         (contains? #{\"constant\" \"string\" \"arrayCreation\"} (:rule (first ks))))))\n2068:(defn- lower-class-constant\n2074:      (unsupported! n :class-constant))\n2083:  \"The eight magic constants (plan P6 R7): `__LINE__` from the line table,\n2101:      (unsupported! n :magic-constant))))\n2104:(defn- lower-constant\n2116:          (p/rule? l \"numericConstant\") (numeric-constant ctx l)\n2118:          (constant-node ctx n {:segs [(:text (first (core/kids ctx l)))]})))\n2119:      (p/rule? k \"qualifiedNamespaceName\") (constant-node ctx n (qname-parts ctx k))\n2121:      (p/rule? k \"classConstant\") (lower-class-constant ctx n k)\n2173:        \"constant\" (lower ctx k0)\n2181:      (and (= 1 cnt) (p/token? k0)) (constant-node ctx n {:segs [(:text k0)]})\n2281:         names [\"expression\" \"constant\" \"literalConstant\" \"numericConstant\"]]\n2750:   parameters; `:default` is the `constantInitializer` node or nil, `:type` the\n2781:  \"A parameter default: a `constantInitializer`.\"\n2786:      (and (= 1 (count ks)) (p/rule? k0 \"constant\")) (lower ctx k0)\n2799:      :else (unsupported! n :constant-expression))))\n2898:  \"`[kind value]` of a `cons